      "content": "idk i feel like my doctor just tells me to \"drink more water\" and that's it, it's so annoying. everyone online says vitamin c is a huge immune booster and helps flush out toxins. if i take the 2500mg daily it'll probably just help clear everything out faster right? i'm pretty sure it's fine as long as i'm drinking water.",
