      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i saw a bunch of wellness influencers saying that mega-dosing vitamin c is basically a natural cleanse for the organs. if i'm taking 2500mg it's basically just more vitamin, right? it's not like it's some dangerous drug. surely it wouldn't actually make my stones worse, it would just help my immune system handle the stress? i just want a clear answer so i can start taking it tomorrow.",
